{"title":"Euclid 2019/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Euclid_2019/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>(a)\n</p><p>(b)\n</p><p>(c) The line with equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/4/6e47ae773f37e46eab771afd5aaf89343d2b9a7a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+3y=7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"86\" height=\"17\" /> is parallel to the line with equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/5/335977913022df1fb3a473f90be2743ad42ada67.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=mx+b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"90\" height=\"16\" />. The line with equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/5/335977913022df1fb3a473f90be2743ad42ada67.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=mx+b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"90\" height=\"16\" />\npasses through the point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/f/adfd79531f2755436c50b2d6f74b761ac62c8681.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(9, 2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"42\" height=\"20\" />. Determine the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Euclid_2019/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>(a)\n</p><p>(b)\n</p><p>(c)\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018083731\nCache expiry: 86400\